### =========================================
### PENGUJIAN READ (GET)
### =========================================

### 1. GET Semua Jadwal (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php

### 2. GET Jadwal dengan Filter Tujuan (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?tujuan=Pulau Bunyu

### 3. GET Jadwal by ID Valid (Expected: 200 OK)
# Catatan: Sesuaikan angka id=1 dengan ID yang ada di database Anda
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=1

### 4. GET Jadwal by ID Invalid / Tidak Ada (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=9999


### =========================================
### PENGUJIAN CREATE (POST)
### =========================================

### 5. POST Tambah Jadwal Baru (Expected: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "armada_id": 1,
    "pelabuhan_id": 2,
    "harga": 150000,
    "berangkat": "08:00:00",
    "tiba": "09:30:00",
    "lokasi": "Dermaga 2"
}

### 6. POST Tambah Jadwal Tanpa ID (Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity)
# Ini untuk menguji validasi error handling kita
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "harga": 150000,
    "berangkat": "08:00:00"
}


### =========================================
### PENGUJIAN UPDATE (PUT)
### =========================================

### 7. PUT Update Harga Jadwal (Expected: 200 OK)
# Catatan: Ubah angka ?id=... dengan "inserted_id" yang Anda dapat dari hasil POST nomor 5
PUT http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "harga": 175000
}

### 8. PUT Update Jadwal Invalid / Tidak Ada (Expected: 404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "harga": 175000
}


### =========================================
### PENGUJIAN DELETE (DELETE)
### =========================================

### 9. DELETE Hapus Jadwal (Expected: 204 No Content)
# Catatan: Ubah angka ?id=... dengan ID yang ingin dihapus
DELETE http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=1

### 10. DELETE Hapus Jadwal Invalid / Tidak Ada (Expected: 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=9999